some can take months to prepare for Junior Year Gain real experience and start building your professional network. Land an internship, co-op, or part-time job in your field Get your resume reviewed by a career counselor — before you need it Start networking with alumni and professionals now, not later Considering grad school? Research programs and register for entrance exams Senior Year Turn your plan into a job offer — or your next degree. Polish your resume and register for career fairs Practice your interview skills before the real thing; practice truly helps Build a job search plan with Career Services Lock in your references, and don’t forget to request your free copy of Job Choices — a handy guide to the job market nationwide KEEP LOOKING Helpful Job Search Resources USAJobs.gov — Search federal government job openings CareerOneStop — U.S. Department of Labor career exploration tools O*NET Online — Explore careers and see detailed job descriptions, skills, and requirements Occupational Outlook Handbook — U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics career profiles, including pay and job outlook NACE Salary Calculator Center — Estimate salaries by job title, location, and experience LinkedIn Jobs — Search jobs and build your professional network Kentucky Nonprofit Network — Nonprofit job openings across Kentucky Always Here When You Need Us Visit or Contact Career Services Office Hours: Monday–Friday, 8:00 a.m.–4:30 p.m. Evenings by appointment Staff: Nathan Hall, Career Services Director Location: 2nd Floor, Jerry C. Davis Student Center, Room 208 Contact: Alice Lloyd College Career Service Office 100 Purpose Rd, Pippa Passes, KY 41844 Phone: (606) 368-6136 Email: [email protected] Help Prepare the Next Generation of Appalachian Leaders Alice Lloyd College is a 501(c)(3) tax-exempt organization. EIN: 61-0492351. Give The Gift of Tuition Alice Lloyd College Alice Lloyd College is a private, Christian Work College located in Pippa Passes, Kentucky, committed to providing accessible, purpose-driven education for students across Appalachia. Facebook-f Instagram Youtube Tiktok Quick Links About Alice Lloyd College June Buchanan School News Schedule a Visit How to Apply Our Service Area Our Values About Alice Lloyd College June Buchanan School News Schedule a Visit How to Apply Our Service Area Our Values Visit Us 100 Purpose Rd, Pippa Passes, KY 41844 (606) 368-6000 Designed By Forcht Media Copyright © 2026 All rights reserved."
